{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/c3ab0d4eb9a32ab924f26800bf35afad.avif?t=1762151346\" width=628 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple\u2014just up, down, left, and right! ...And surprisingly deep!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.poster.avif?t=1762151346\" width=270 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.webm?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.mp4?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks placed whenever the player's cursor moves disappear when two or more blocks of the same color are lined up. If you can't move them anymore,it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the basic rules, clearing the stage means destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode (2P)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Versus Mode, you can choose between player vs. player battles and battles against the CPU.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Star<br>Break the star blocks. The first player to break five star blocks wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original<br>Similar to 1P mode, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2 characters \u201cDr. Kyanta\u201d and \u201cMasako\u201d dance on screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat BGM by composer tdhr!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulty levels\u2014\u201cEASY,\u201d \u201cNORMAL,\u201d and \u201cHARD\u201d\u2014to play!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream gameplay videos and post videos, whether for profit or not. We would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the game's Steam store page in the description section of your videos or streams. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Was it easy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/7485bb5eea29c6103f149c1e353317f3cc0a69fa.jpg"},{"name":"What is normal?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/e10677b676c46d89cff8a7f7059e9a644ae037d4.jpg"},{"name":"It's very hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/d2c961028d6991c1e3560133d3eaaf169d76d848.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the third hardest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/e1d7ca43d287dd8b5b763be7897efd125c2a17c3.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the second hardest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/b618b039ace96ebaecc611b62cffb696f694ef71.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the hardest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3888240/264f37f66f69dd33229630e2b02d09ad2172700f.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888240?t=1762151346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888240?t=1762151346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam